SuperStore Executive Dashboard
Overview

This project presents an interactive Power BI dashboard built using the SuperStore dataset. The dashboard provides key business insights into sales performance, profitability, customer behavior, and regional trends.

Objectives
Analyze sales and profit performance.
Identify top-performing products and categories.
Track regional and segment-wise performance.
Support data-driven business decision-making.
Key Metrics
Total Sales
Total Profit
Profit Margin
Number of Orders
Average Order Value
Customer Segments Performance
Dashboard Features
Sales trend analysis
Profitability analysis
Category and sub-category breakdown
Regional performance comparison
Interactive filtering and drill-down capabilities
